# NAME: Custom Direct
# MAINTAINER: cyenx
# FORMAT: Surge RULE-SET (policy is supplied by the caller)
# SOURCE: Migrated from the personal Surge profile on 2026-09-03
#
# Steam game downloads and CDN selection must bypass the proxy. These rules
# override the broader upstream Steam rules, which keep other Steam traffic on
# the general proxy policy.
#
# Current data-plane hosts are derived from Valve's GetSteamPipeDomains API.
# steamserver.net and api.steampowered.com keep the CM/CDN selection path on the
# real client network; CM hostnames cannot be split further by service role.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,steamserver.net
DOMAIN,api.steampowered.com
DOMAIN,cs.steampowered.com

# Valve and partner game-content endpoints. Use exact matches for third-party
# CDN domains so unrelated provider traffic continues through the proxy.
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,steamcontent.com
DOMAIN,cdn-ali.content.steamchina.com
DOMAIN,cdn-qc.content.steamchina.com
DOMAIN,cdn-ws.content.steamchina.com
DOMAIN,dl.steam.clngaa.com
DOMAIN,edge.steam-dns.top.comcast.net
DOMAIN,lv.queniujq.cn
# Valve no longer advertises this host, but it still served a verified Steam
# depot chunk on 2026-09-03, so keep it as a legacy download fallback.
DOMAIN,st.dl.bscstorage.net
DOMAIN,st.dl.eccdnx.com
DOMAIN,steam.cdn.on.net
DOMAIN,steampipe-kr.akamaized.net
DOMAIN,steampipe-partner.akamaized.net
DOMAIN,steampipe-sc.akamaized.net
DOMAIN,steampipe-tr.akamaized.net
DOMAIN,steampipe.akamaized.net
DOMAIN,xz.pphimalayanrt.com
